  "content_html": "<p>Thanks for reading Stock Analysis Compilation! Subscribe for free to receive new posts and support my work.</p><blockquote><h3><strong>New: we’re on Instagram. 🚀</strong></h3><figure><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vJxf!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff4c8daf9-4b0a-44f4-bdbf-96c608ad9d6d_32x32.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!vJxf!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff4c8daf9-4b0a-44f4-bdbf-96c608ad9d6d_32x32.png\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" alt=\"📸\" title=\"📸\" loading=\"lazy\" /></a></figure><p>We just launched an Instagram account. Every week we turn the best pitches and fund-letter takeaways into swipeable breakdowns — <a href=\"https://instagram.com/hfbestideas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">follow @hfbestideas</a> if that’s your format.</p><p><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/hfbestideas\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Follow @hfbestideas</a></p></blockquote><blockquote><p>Now, let’s get into this week’s selection of pitches from investment newsletters 👇</p></blockquote><hr /><h3>USA</h3><p><a href=\"https://www.bristlemoonresearch.com/p/googles-ai-return-on-investment\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Alphabet (GOOGL US) by bristlemoonresearch</a></p><p><a href=\"https://investresearch.substack.com/p/caris-life-sciences-the-quiet-founder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Caris Life Sciences (CAI US) by investresearch</a></p><p><a href=\"https://indrastocks.substack.com/p/cvna-earnings-prep\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Carvana (CVNA US) by indrastocks</a></p><p><a href=\"https://dbsilverfox.substack.com/p/the-moat-is-wide-it-has-stopped-widening\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Copart, Inc